    "text": "8 hours ago A Lenawee County man has been found guilty in the shooting death of his wife following his trial before Circuit Court Judge Michael Olsaver. Stephen Maples was found guilty of second-degree murder in connection with the death of his wife, Cathy Ann Maples, 72. He was also found guilty of possession of a firearm during the commission of a felony. Read full article",
